      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A study of 34 patients with 2-3 months history of myocardial infarction revealed that 10-day course of treatment with SKN enterosorbent resulted in normalization of lipid peroxidation and several indices of lipid metabolism. These changes were in a part of the patients accompanied by an increase of tolerance to physical load and reduced requirement of the myocardium in oxygen."},
